[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Taxi]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:09.28]Does Captain Fawcett think any trip is too dangerous? | 福塞特上尉认为哪次飞行都危险吗？
[00:15.69]Captain Ben Fawcett has bought an unusual taxi and has begun a new service. | 本·福塞特上尉买来一辆不同寻常的出租车，并开始了一项新的业务。
[00:23.34]The 'taxi' is a small Swiss aeroplane called a 'Pilatus Porter'. | 这辆“出租车”是一架小型瑞士飞机，叫“ Pilatus Porter（皮勒特斯·波特）”号。
[00:29.69]This wonderful plane can carry seven passengers. | 这架奇妙的飞机可以载7名乘客。
[00:34.40]The most surprising thing about it, however, is that it can land anywhere: on snow, water, or even on a ploughed field. | 然而，最令人惊奇的是，它能够在任何地方降落：雪地上，水面上，甚至刚耕过的田里。
[00:47.11]Captain Fawcett's first passenger was a doctor who flew from Birmingham to a lonely village in the Welsh mountains. | 福塞特上尉的第一位乘客是位医生，他从伯明翰飞往威尔士山区一个偏僻的村庄。
[00:56.89]Since then, Captain Fawcett has flown passengers to many unusual places. | 从那时开始，福塞特上尉载乘客飞往过许多不寻常的地方。
[01:04.48]Once he landed on the roof of a block of flats and on another occasion, he landed in a deserted car park. | 一次，他把飞机降落在了一栋公寓楼的屋顶上；还有一次，他降落在一个废弃的停车场上。
[01:14.86]Captain Fawcett has just refused a strange request from a businessman. | 福塞特上尉刚刚拒绝了一位商人的奇怪要求。
[01:21.17]The man wanted to fly to Rockall, a lonely island in the Atlantic Ocean, | 这个人想飞往大西洋上的一个孤岛——罗卡尔岛，
[01:28.27]but Captain Fawcett did not take him because the trip was too dangerous. | 但福塞特上尉没有送他去，因为那段飞行太危险了。
